# Plugin: Systematic Debugging

Purpose:
  Adapt systematic debugging skill for SDDRA bugfix/hotfix chains.

Owns: plugins\plugin-adapters\systematic-debugging.sdd
Adaptation:
  Maps 4-phase root cause investigation to bugfix chain:
    Phase 1 (Root Cause) -> AR (Architecture) stage
    Phase 2 (Hypothesis) -> AR stage continuation
    Phase 3 (Fix) -> BE (Backend) stage
    Phase 4 (Verify) -> VR (Verify) stage

  Iron Law: NO CODE CHANGE WITHOUT ROOT CAUSE INVESTIGATION FIRST

Usage:
  Chain: bugfix, hotfix, incident (AR stage)
  Trigger: Bug report, test failure, production incident

State: +
